### Create Delivery

POST http://localhost:8087/api/v1/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ord-12345",
  "userId": "user-67890",
  "shippingAddress": "123 Main St, City, Country",
  "carrier": "FedEx"
}

###
### Get Delivery by Delivery ID
GET http://localhost:8087/api/v1/deliveries/1

###
### Update Delivery Status
PUT http://localhost:8087/api/v1/deliveries/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ASSIGNED",
  "trackingNumber": "FX123456789"
}
